              "help": {
                "text": "Remove instruction overrides, secret-disclosure requests and unrelated tool redirection from tool and parameter descriptions. FP risk: Medium: legitimate security tooling may quote attack instructions; explicit quoted warnings are excluded, and remaining candidates need review."
